PWM Out Introduction The pwm_out class is used to control PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) output on a VEX V5 3-Wire port. It allows devices to send variable-width pulse signals to compatible 3-Wire components. Class Constructors pwm_out(
  triport::port &port ); Class Destructor Destroys the pwm_out object and releases associated resources. ~pwm_out(); Parameters Parameter Type Description port triport::port & The 3-Wire Port the PWM output is connected to, written as Brain.ThreeWirePort.X or ExpanderName.X , where X is the port letter (for example, Brain.ThreeWirePort.A or Expander1.A ). Example // Create the pwm_out instance on 3-Wire Port A
pwm_out pwm = pwm_out(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); Member Functions The pwm_out class includes the following member functions: state — Sets the state of the PWM output. Before calling any pwm_out member functions, a pwm_out instance must be created, as shown below: /* This constructor is required when using VS Code.
PWM configuration is generated automatically
in VEXcode using the Device Menu. Replace the values
as needed. */

// Create the pwm_out instance on 3-Wire Port A
pwm_out pwm = pwm_out(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); state Sets the state of the PWM output to a specified value. Available Functions void state(
  int32_t      value,
  percentUnits units ); Parameters Parameter Type Description value int32_t The new value to set for PWM output, from -100 to +100 percent. units percentUnits The unit used to represent the PWM value: percent / pct — percent Return Values This function does not return a value. Notes The PWM output value ranges from -100 to +100 percent. The only valid unit for PWM output is percent . Examples // Set the PWM Output to 50%
pwm.state(50, percent);

// Set the PWM Output to -75%
pwm.state(-75, percent);

documents.zhText:
PWM 输出 概述 pwm_out 类用于控制 VEX V5 三线端口上的 PWM（脉冲宽度调制）输出。它允许设备向兼容的 3 线组件发送可变宽度脉冲信号。 构造函数 pwm_out(
  triport::port &port ); 析构函数 销毁 pwm_out 对象并释放关联资源。 ~pwm_out(); 参数 参数 类型 说明 port triport::port & PWM 输出连接的三线端口，写作 Brain.ThreeWirePort.X 或 ExpanderName.X ，其中 X 为端口号（例如 Brain.ThreeWirePort.A 或 Expander1.A ）。 示例 // Create the pwm_out instance on 3-Wire Port A
pwm_out pwm = pwm_out(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); 成员函数 pwm_out 类包含以下成员函数： state — 设置 PWM 输出的状态。 在调用任何 pwm_out 成员函数之前，必须创建一个 pwm_out 实例，如下所示： /* This constructor is required when using VS Code.
PWM configuration is generated automatically
in VEXcode using the Device Menu. Replace the values
as needed. */

// Create the pwm_out instance on 3-Wire Port A
pwm_out pwm = pwm_out(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); state 将 PWM 输出的状态设置为指定值。 函数重载 void state(
  int32_t      value,
  percentUnits units ); 参数 参数 类型 说明 value int32_t 为 PWM 输出设置的新值，从 -100% 到 +100%。 units percentUnits 用于表示 PWM 值的单位： percent / pct — 百分比 返回值 此函数无返回值。 说明与注意事项 PWM 输出值范围为 -100% 至 +100%。 PWM 输出的唯一有效单位是 percent 。 示例 // Set the PWM Output to 50%
pwm.state(50, percent);

// Set the PWM Output to -75%
pwm.state(-75, percent);

