Potentiometer Introduction The pot and potV2 classes are used with Potentiometers, which are analog sensors that measure the angular position of a rotating shaft. A Potentiometer outputs a voltage proportional to its position. Depending on the Potentiometer version, the amount of rotation it can detect varies: Potentiometer - Up to 250 degrees Potentiometer V2 - 330 degrees (Continuous) Potentiometer Potentiometer V2 Potentiometer Class Constructors pot(
  triport::port &port ); Class Destructor Destroys the pot object and releases associated resources. ~pot(); Parameters Parameter Type Description port triport::port & The 3-Wire Port the Potentiometer is connected to, written as Brain.ThreeWirePort.X or ExpanderName.X , where X is the port letter (for example, Brain.ThreeWirePort.A or Expander1.A ). Example // Create a pot instance in Port A
pot PotentiometerA = pot(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); Potentiometer V2 Class Constructors potV2(
  triport::port &port ); Class Destructor Destroys the potV2 object and releases associated resources. ~potV2(); Parameters Parameter Type Description port triport::port & The 3-Wire Port the Potentiometer V2 is connected to, written as Brain.ThreeWirePort.X or ExpanderName.X , where X is the port letter (for example, Brain.ThreeWirePort.A or Expander1.A ). Examples // Create a Potentiometer V2 on 3-Wire Port A
potV2 PotentiometerV2A = potV2(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); Member Functions The pot and potV2 classes include the following member functions: angle — Returns the angular position of the Potentiometer in degrees or as a percent. Before calling any pot or potV2 member functions, a pot or potV2 instance must be created, as shown below: /* This constructor is required when using VS Code.
Potentiometer configuration is generated automatically
in VEXcode using the Device Menu. Replace the values
as needed. */

// Create a potV2 instance in Port A
potV2 PotentiometerV2A = potV2(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); angle Returns the angular position of the Potentiometer. 1 — This function represents the angle as a percent. int32_t angle (
  percentUnits units = percentUnits::pct ); 2 — This function represents the angle as the chosen rotation units. double angle(
  rotationUnits units ); Parameters Parameter Type Description units percentUnits The unit that represents the position as a percentage of full rotation: percent / pct (default) — percent, from 0 to 100%. units rotationUnits The unit that represents the angle: deg / degrees — degrees, from 0 to 250 for a Potentiometer or 0 to 330 for a Potentiometer V2 turns / rev — revolutions Return Values Returns: An int32_t when using percentUnits . A double when using rotationUnits . Examples // Get the current angle of the Potentiometer V2 in the
// range 0 to 330 degrees.
double angle = PotentiometerV2A.angle(degrees);

// Print the current angle of the Potentiometer to the
// brain screen.
Brain.Screen.print(angle);

documents.zhText:
电位器 概述 pot 和 potV2 类与电位计一起使用，电位计是测量旋转轴角位置的模拟传感器。电位计输出与其位置成比例的电压。 根据电位计版本的不同，它可以检测到的旋转量也有所不同： 电位器 - 高达 250 度 电位器 V2 - 330 度（连续） 电位器 电位器V2 电位器 构造函数 pot(
  triport::port &port ); 析构函数 销毁 pot 对象并释放关联资源。 ~pot(); 参数 参数 类型 说明 port triport::port & 电位器连接的三线端口，写为 Brain.ThreeWirePort.X 或 ExpanderName.X ，其中 X 为端口号（例如 Brain.ThreeWirePort.A 或 Expander1.A ）。 示例 // Create a pot instance in Port A
pot PotentiometerA = pot(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); 电位器V2 构造函数 potV2(
  triport::port &port ); 析构函数 销毁 potV2 对象并释放关联资源。 ~potV2(); 参数 参数 类型 说明 port triport::port & 电位器 V2 连接的三线端口，写作 Brain.ThreeWirePort.X 或 ExpanderName.X ，其中 X 为端口号（例如 Brain.ThreeWirePort.A 或 Expander1.A ）。 示例 // Create a Potentiometer V2 on 3-Wire Port A
potV2 PotentiometerV2A = potV2(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); 成员函数 pot 和 potV2 类包括以下成员函数： angle — 返回电位计的角度位置（以度或百分比表示）。 在调用任何 pot 或 potV2 成员函数之前，必须创建 pot 或 potV2 实例，如下所示： /* This constructor is required when using VS Code.
Potentiometer configuration is generated automatically
in VEXcode using the Device Menu. Replace the values
as needed. */

// Create a potV2 instance in Port A
potV2 PotentiometerV2A = potV2(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); angle 返回电位计的角度位置。 1 — 该函数将角度表示为百分比。 int32_t angle (
  percentUnits units = percentUnits::pct ); 2 — 该函数将角度表示为所选旋转单位。 double angle(
  rotationUnits units ); 参数 参数 类型 说明 units percentUnits 将位置表示为完整旋转百分比的单位： percent / pct （默认）— 百分比，从 0 到 100%。 units rotationUnits 表示角度的单位： deg / degrees — 度，对于电位计为 0 到 250，对于电位计 V2 为 0 到 330 turns / rev — 转数 返回值 返回： 使用 percentUnits 时为 int32_t 。 使用 rotationUnits 时为 double 。 示例 // Get the current angle of the Potentiometer V2 in the
// range 0 to 330 degrees.
double angle = PotentiometerV2A.angle(degrees);

// Print the current angle of the Potentiometer to the
// brain screen.
Brain.Screen.print(angle);

documents.text:
Range Finder Introduction The sonar class is used with the Ultrasonic Range Finder, which measures the distance to the nearest object using sound waves. It works by sending out an ultrasonic pulse and measuring how long it takes for the sound to bounce back. Class Constructor sonar(
  triport::port &port); Class Destructor Destroys the sonar object and releases associated resources. virtual ~sonar(); Parameters Parameter Type Description port triport::port & The first 3-Wire Port of a required two-port group used by the Range Finder. The Range Finder occupies two adjacent ports (A–B, C–D, E–F, or G–H) on either the Brain or a 3-Wire Expander. Specify the first port in the pair (A, C, E, or G), written as Brain.ThreeWirePort.X or ExpanderName.X where X is the port letter (for example, Brain.ThreeWirePort.A or Expander1.C ). Examples // Create a sonar instance in Ports A and B
sonar RangeFinderA = sonar(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); Member Functions The sonar class includes the following member functions: foundObject — Returns whether the Range Finder detects an object. distance — Returns the distance between the Range Finder and the nearest detected object. Before calling any sonar member functions, a sonar instance must be created, as shown below: /* This constructor is required when using VS Code.
Range Finder configuration is generated automatically
in VEXcode using the Device Menu. Replace the values
as needed. */

// Create a sonar instance in Ports A and B
sonar RangeFinderA = sonar(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); foundObject Returns whether the Range Finder detects an object within its field of view. Available Functions bool foundObject(); Parameters This function does not accept any parameters. Return Values Returns a bool representing whether the Range Finder detects an object: true — The Range Finder is detecting an object. false — The Range Finder is not detecting an object. Examples // Check if an object is detected.
if (RangeFinderA.foundObject()){
    // Print to screen on the brain that an object was found.
    Brain.Screen.print("object found");
} distance Returns the measured distance to the nearest object detected by the sensor. Available Functions double distance(
  distanceUnits units ); Parameters Parameter Type Description units distanceUnits The unit that represents the distance: inches or mm — millimeters. Return Values Returns a double representing the distance in the specified units. Examples // Get the Range Finder distance in millimeters.
double value = RangeFinderA.distance(mm);

// Print the current distance detected by the Range Finder to the
// Brain's screen.
Brain.Screen.print(value);

documents.zhText:
超声波测距传感器 概述 sonar 类与超声波测距仪配合使用，利用声波测量到最近物体的距离。它的工作原理是发出超声波脉冲并测量声音反弹所需的时间。 构造函数 sonar(
  triport::port &port); 析构函数 销毁 sonar 对象并释放关联资源。 virtual ~sonar(); 参数 参数 类型 说明 port triport::port & 测距仪使用的所需二端口组的第一个三线端口。测距仪占用主控器或 3 线扩展器上的两个相邻端口（A–B、C–D、E–F 或 G–H）。指定端口对（A、C、E 或 G）中的第一个端口，写作 Brain.ThreeWirePort.X 或 ExpanderName.X ，其中 X 是端口号（例如， Brain.ThreeWirePort.A 或 Expander1.C ）。 示例 // Create a sonar instance in Ports A and B
sonar RangeFinderA = sonar(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); 成员函数 sonar 类包含以下成员函数： foundObject — 返回测距仪是否检测到对象。 distance — 返回测距仪与最近检测到的物体之间的距离。 在调用任何 sonar 成员函数之前，必须创建一个 sonar 实例，如下所示： /* This constructor is required when using VS Code.
Range Finder configuration is generated automatically
in VEXcode using the Device Menu. Replace the values
as needed. */

// Create a sonar instance in Ports A and B
sonar RangeFinderA = sonar(Brain.ThreeWirePort.A); foundObject 返回测距仪是否在其视野内检测到对象。 函数重载 bool foundObject(); 参数 该函数不接受任何参数。 返回值 返回一个 bool 表示测距仪是否检测到对象： true — 测距仪正在检测物体。 false — 测距仪未检测到物体。 示例 // Check if an object is detected.
if (RangeFinderA.foundObject()){
    // Print to screen on the brain that an object was found.
    Brain.Screen.print("object found");
} distance 返回到传感器检测到的最近物体的测量距离。 函数重载 double distance(
  distanceUnits units ); 参数 参数 类型 说明 units distanceUnits 表示距离的单位： inches 或 mm — 毫米。 返回值 返回一个 double ，表示指定单位的距离。 示例 // Get the Range Finder distance in millimeters.
double value = RangeFinderA.distance(mm);

// Print the current distance detected by the Range Finder to the
// Brain's screen.
Brain.Screen.print(value);

